    IF `it has made arrangements to ensure that its supervisory functions are exercised independently of its other functions which do not relate to disciplinary matters`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "must make arrangements to ensure that" (Marginal readings, (c))
    ELSE JUST FALSE

-- src:1680 | (b) sensitive information relating to the supervisory functions is appropriately handled within the organisation;
@ref reg 49(1)(b) (src:1680)
