    IF `it has made arrangements to ensure that sensitive information relating to the supervisory functions is appropriately handled within the organisation`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "must make arrangements to ensure that" (Marginal readings, (c))
    ELSE JUST FALSE

-- src:1681 | (c) they employ only persons with appropriate qualifications, integrity and professional skills to carry out the supervisory functions;
@ref reg 49(1)(c) (src:1681)
