`reg 49(1)(e) the self-regulatory organisation has made arrangements to ensure that potential conflicts of interest are appropriately handled` MEANS
    IF `it has made arrangements to ensure that potential conflicts of interest within the organisation are appropriately handled`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "must make arrangements to ensure that" (Marginal readings, (c))
    ELSE JUST FALSE

-- src:1678 | (1) Self-regulatory organisations must make arrangements to ensure that—
